So.... there is an workaround for that... in your `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` file you can add:
```
  "provider": {
    "xai": {
      "models": {
        "grok-composer-2.5-fast": {
          "name": "Composer 2.5 Fast"
        },
        "grok-build-0.1": {
          "name": "Grok Build"
        }
      }
    }
  }
```
With that you have Grok Build and Composer 2.5 there =) after a models refresh

